    "updated_at": "2016-06-29T16:22:08Z",
    "body": "I'm really not a fan of any duplication. It just means more maintenance whenever Fetch updates. This has already been a pain for referrerpolicy that is causing HTML and Referrer Policy to get out of sync (see #1419). I think it's OK to refer authors to another spec to see the valid values.\n",
